{
  "slug": "critique",
  "name": "Critique",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Permanent critical mindset mode. Surfaces real bugs, questionable decisions, and unhandled edge  cases — ordered by impact, no sugarcoating.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `critique` (Permanent critical mindset — balanced co-pilot for the session), `rigorous` (Deep analysis mode — critical thinking before and during coding, reviewing, or planning), `scan` (One-shot critical scan — surfaces only critical blockers in what was just shown)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install critique@claude-community` from `Alfafis/critique`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 2
  },
